> f(x: u4) = (x + 3) & 15
> g(x: u4) = ((x + 3) & 15) + (x == 7 ? 1 : 0)
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 1 point, e.g. x=7: 10 vs 11
> equiv g f
g and f differ at 1 point, e.g. x=7: 11 vs 10
> range f
range of f -> u4:
  0..15   (16 distinct values)
  values: 0..15
  fits in u4
  over all 16 points of the domain
> range g
